fact WorkItem(id: "WI-569", description: some(value: "WI-502 Step 0 — persistent substitution substrate. Replace Substitution.bindings (HashMap<VarId,Value>) with imbl::HashMap (persistent HAMT, O(1) structural clone; imbl is already a direct dep, precedent eval/map_arena.rs) so the per-frame frame.subst.clone() at each resolution step becomes O(1) instead of an O(bindings) deep copy — eliminating the O(depth^2) copy that would otherwise bottleneck carrying a growing constraint store (the WI-537 Gamma-OOM shape). Behavior-preserving: same lookup/insert semantics; rewrite bind_compressed's in-place iter_mut path-compression as collect-keys-then-functional-insert; KEEP the parent chain (frame substs are parent=None, so it does not compromise O(1); parent removal deferred). Prerequisite for WI-502 (constrained-term substrate; see docs/design/constrained-term-substrate.md, Step 0). Acceptance: cargo-test green via scripts/test.sh."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-06-26T11:52:28Z"))
